# amd64 PROPRIETARY NVIDIA driver stack.
# Concatenated onto packages-gpu.list by the builder ONLY when
# --nvidia-driver proprietary (NVIDIA_PROPRIETARY=true). The open Mesa/Vulkan
# stack (packages-gpu.list) is still built so OpenGL/Vulkan works on non-NVIDIA
# GPUs and as a fallback; nouveau is blacklisted at runtime (modprobe.d) so the
# proprietary kmod owns any NVIDIA GPU. NVIDIA-r2 EULA is accepted via
# package.license/nvidia. USE flags (kernel-open etc.) are in package.use/nvidia.
x11-drivers/nvidia-drivers
